    "project": "EX-07",
    "client": "Example residential block (4 floors)",
    "author": "uniwire examples",
    
    "drawing_number": "EX-07-E-001",
    "notes": [
      "Demonstrates: multi-sheet building distribution with the main LV board in the meter room, two rising mains (own_sheet) with floor tap boxes, 12 individually metered apartments (offpage to the typical apartment board), landlord common services and car-park EV charging with dynamic load management",
      "Apartments are balanced across L1/L2/L3 (column Phase). Safety circuits (fire alarm, emergency lighting) marked priority=safety, fire-resistant cable",
      "EV chargers controlled by a dynamic load manager over OCPP (data links), total EV current capped at 63 A"
    ]
  },
